  "operative_text": "Section 1 (SDCL 32-20A-11): The restrictions in this section do not apply to a utility-terrain vehicle (UTV) or any vehicle that is designed for four or more low-pressure tires or rubberized tracks, and has a seat a person sits upon, and has a steering wheel.\nSection 2 (SDCL 32-20-6.6): The restrictions in this section do not apply to a utility terrain vehicle (UTV) or any vehicle that is designed for four or more low-pressure tires or rubberized tracks, and has a seat a person sits upon, and has a steering wheel."
